      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1380216024,
          "type": null,
          "body": "This needs to be updated. tapFinish gets called when the file is closed but the dialog if still open still needs its data. The data should be reset manually in the destructor and there should be no tapFinish call. In some cases this can cause segfaults.",
